Modified by Tutor Trellis: iOS's own picture in picture window for calls (a
native module, a JS feature behind the ios.system-pip.enabled feature flag that
also keeps the camera on while the window shows and gives way to the same
person's other device, and memory fixes in react-native-webrtc's picture in
picture renderer). The changes are the patches in patches/, applied to that
commit before building.
